    "---\n",
    "## Task 1 — Dataset Selection <a id='2'></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### ✅ Selected Dataset: **CoNLL-2003**\n",
    "\n",
    "CoNLL-2003 is the standard benchmark for sequence labelling tasks in NLP. It provides **three** annotation types on the same sentences:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Annotation | Column | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **POS Tags** | `pos_tags` | Part-of-Speech labels (NN, VBZ, IN …) |\n",
    "| **Chunk Tags** | `chunk_tags` | Phrase-level labels in BIO format (B-NP, I-NP, B-VP …) |\n",
    "| NER Tags | `ner_tags` | Named entity labels (not used in this assignment) |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Label categories — POS Tags (45 classes):**  \n",
    "`CC, CD, DT, EX, FW, IN, JJ, JJR, JJS, LS, MD, NN, NNS, NNP, NNPS, PDT, POS, PRP, PRP$, RB, RBR, RBS, RP, SYM, TO, UH, VB, VBD, VBG, VBN, VBP, VBZ, WDT, WP, WP$, WRB, #, $, '', (, ), ,, ., :, \\`\\`, -X-`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Label categories — Chunk Tags (BIO format, 22 classes):**  \n",
    "`O, B-NP, I-NP, B-VP, I-VP, B-PP, I-PP, B-ADJP, I-ADJP, B-ADVP, I-ADVP, B-SBAR, I-SBAR, B-PRT, I-PRT, B-CONJP, I-CONJP, B-INTJ, I-INTJ, B-LST, I-LST, B-UCP`"
   ]
  },
